			"notes": "## Changes\n\n- Limited owner-derived collision team lookups to nearby candidates, avoiding unnecessary entity lookups and chunk loading.\n- Fixed incomplete entity-query results when callbacks perform nested queries.\n\n\n## Minecraft 1.21.1\n\nAdded the 1.21.1 backport from [v1.0.0-mc1.21.1-alpha.10](https://github.com/water2004/EntityCollisionOptimizer/tree/v1.0.0-mc1.21.1-alpha.10). Download `entity_collision_optimizer-1.0.0-mc1.21.1-alpha.10.jar`; `SHA256SUMS-mc1.21.1.txt` records the source commit and checksum.\n\nRequires Java 22+ and `--enable-native-access=ALL-UNNAMED`, plus Fabric API for Minecraft 1.21.1. Includes chunk-loading deadlock prevention, lazy/reentrant team metadata, nested query counts, native failure reporting, and Fuji field compatibility. The version-tag release workflow completed its build, contract GameTests, and cross-process vanilla comparison before uploading these assets. Windows x64 was exercised; Linux/macOS x64 libraries were cross-compiled."
		},
